title: where we agree
pid: 5339416b-3997-4a10-8f2f-0c6a431138f6
body: |2-
  His "mark another's changes processed" is my second wish nearly word for word: marks kept in my skgrepo, returning when he edits the note again, and visible to him.
  His complaint that a subscription reaches one layer deep is what I met with Gen.
  His "merge another's changes into one's own data ... feels awkward" is what I met forking "management team".
